Hello {!Contact.FirstName},

Thank you for contacting Arizona State University. ASU offers a limited number of merit-based scholarships for highly qualified degree-seeking international freshman students who will attend ASU on an F-1 or J-1 Visa.

You must apply to ASU by April 1 to be automatically considered for the New American University Scholarship. There is no separate scholarship application to complete and the maximum possible award is $8,000 per year.

To apply, visit https://students.asu.edu/international/future/undergrad.
To search for additional scholarships, visit scholarships.asu.edu/.
To learn more about the New American University Scholarship, visit https://scholarships.asu.edu/scholarship/1728.

Please contact me if you have any questions.

Sincerely,

{!User.Recruiter_Full_Name__c}
{!User.Recruiter_Title__c}
Admission Services
{!User.Recruiter_Email__c}
{!User.Recruiter_Phone__c}

If you have any additional information or questions related to this, please reply to this email.

{!Case.Thread_Id}
